# {{company.legalName}}

## Investment Summary

**To:** {{investor.name}}

Thank you for investing in {{company.shortName}}. Your investment is made under a {{raise.instrumentName}} (an "FEA").

This summary explains the key points in plain English. It is not part of the legal agreement and is not legally binding. If anything in this summary differs from the agreement that follows, the agreement applies.

**What is an FEA?** You provide funds (or agreed value) to the Company now. Instead of receiving shares straight away, you receive shares later, usually when the Company completes its next equity funding round, at a price set by the rules in the agreement.

**Your investment:** {{money investor.investmentAmount}}{{#if (ne investor.consideration.type "CASH")}}, provided by way of {{investor.consideration.summaryLabel}} rather than a cash transfer (see the Investor Specific Terms){{/if}}.

**What counts as the next funding round?** The Company raising at least {{money terms.qualifyingRoundThreshold}} in equity (counting FEAs and similar instruments), in one or more closings, before {{computed.longstopText}}.

**The price you convert at:**
{{#if (eq terms.valuationMechanism "DISCOUNT_AND_CAP")}}
If a funding round or a sale happens before {{computed.longstopText}}, your investment converts at whichever gives you the lower price: (i) a {{pct terms.discountPercent}} discount to the price paid by new investors, or (ii) a company valuation of {{money terms.valuationCap}}.
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq terms.valuationMechanism "DISCOUNT_ONLY")}}
If a funding round or a sale happens before {{computed.longstopText}}, your investment converts at a {{pct terms.discountPercent}} discount to the price paid by new investors.
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq terms.valuationMechanism "CAP_ONLY")}}
If a funding round or a sale happens before {{computed.longstopText}}, your investment converts at the price paid by new investors, but never at a company valuation higher than {{money terms.valuationCap}}.
{{/if}}
{{#if (eq terms.valuationMechanism "FIXED_VALUATION")}}
If a funding round or a sale happens before {{computed.longstopText}}, your investment converts at a fixed company valuation of {{money terms.fixedValuation}}, whatever valuation new investors pay.
{{/if}}

**If no funding round happens:** your investment converts on {{computed.longstopText}} (or earlier if the Company becomes insolvent or is wound up) at a company valuation of {{money terms.longstopValuation}}.
{{#if terms.nomineeConversionEnabled}}

**Nominee holding:** the Company may ask that your shares are held for you by a nominee company. If so, you will sign a nominee agreement. This does not change the economic value of your investment.
{{/if}}
{{#if computed.shareEstimate}}

**Illustration only:** at the current fully diluted share count, your investment would convert into approximately {{computed.shareEstimate.shares}} {{terms.conversionShareClass}} at {{money computed.shareEstimate.pricePerShare 4}} per share. The actual number is fixed at conversion.
{{/if}}

**Next steps:** read the agreement, sign it{{#if (eq investor.consideration.type "CASH")}}, and transfer your funds to the account in the Schedule within {{raise.paymentDeadlineBusinessDays}} Business Days{{/if}}. Keep a copy. The Company will contact you when it is time to convert.

